{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lawgivers has now been expanded and adapted to desktop screens. We put a lot of effort trying to build an innovative political simulation game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/683940/extras/57a0bae79e68b9b44ba4348dda25d7f6.avif?t=1767635483\" width=600 height=155 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lawgivers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lawgivers is a turn-based political simulation game where you can take control of a party and run for elections. Tell voters what they want to hear, and then decide whether to fulfill your promises or not. Once inside parliament, you can approve important laws and shape your country's destiny.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c9  Choose a party, promise actions to citizens and run for elections</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c9  Approve or abolish laws with parliamentary votes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c9  Take care of lawmaker's experience, popularity and loyalty</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c9  Bribe concurrent politicians in order to win majority</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c9  Build up relations with other parties and appoint the president</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605 20 playable nations such as the US, UK, Russia, Germany, or South Korea  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605 Over 140 ordinary and constitutional laws </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605 43 science advances bringing new missions and events </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605 no in-game shop or virtual currency, just free updates</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/683940/extras/1a0c55f1e30ba2cd172e07587dc04f8e.webp?t=1767635483\" width=615 height=55 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"President","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/683940/2dd6b80f76c28fed4c1927859d252b34ce1b1df9.jpg"},{"name":"Tax Tyrant","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/683940/609b192260a53b383eb2864b94500ad3aab83d8d.jpg"},{"name":"Shopping time","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/683940/04a7c544bc8ca2eb84cbfbc2e21a8b308eeafc06.jpg"},{"name":"Sadist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/683940/6a297d3a74eef8522dbc961fe604b9b2f6f988e7.jpg"},{"name":"Revolutionary","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/683940/d91e44d88dea04f849ce0be3e4c274ae7cd5885c.jpg"},{"name":"Baby boom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/683940/09082d5f033101740a9d9478bc29bd923e13450e.jpg"},{"name":"Old pals","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/683940/bb029857e726d64b27a16f03928608f054f7247f.jpg"},{"name":"Dictator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/683940/544b841d4e29f234b320ad03a22ff3eb58c610e4.jpg"},{"name":"Longplayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/683940/483feb987075905484d728c15dc1517af8742034.jpg"},{"name":"Rousseau","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/683940/f2d1aff1f5770ca72fbe24ac1fac41d166530ff0.jpg"}],"total":23},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/683940?t=1767635483","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/683940/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767635483","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/683940/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767635483","capsule_imagev5":"http